    "blurb": "Automated, transparent, resilient trade compliance.",
    "overview": "We combine the power of agentic AI, human expertise and process automation to simplify every step of the Letters of Credit journey. From document validation to compliance enforcement and system integration, each feature is designed to eliminate inefficiencies, reduce uncertainties and deliver transparency across the trade ecosystem.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Agentic AI-powered orchestration and compliance automation for trade finance",
    "splashDescription": "Rising global trade pressures are testing the resilience of supply chains worldwide. Tariff volatility drives\ncost uncertainty and sourcing challenges. Shifting trade policies add compliance complexity. Limited\nvisibility prevents timely organizational response to disruption. Letters of Credit (LC) automation\nsimplifies this by codifying trade rules, streamlining compliance and providing real-time visibility. It\nhelps organizations act with greater speed, consistency and trust.",
